#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: wow-tweaks.php
msgid "WOW Tweaks"
msgstr ""

#. Description of the plugin
#: wow-tweaks.php
msgid "Small adjustments to how WordPress behaves on this site — the kind that would otherwise live as half-remembered lines in wp-config.php."
msgstr ""

#. Author of the plugin
#: wow-tweaks.php
msgid "Wow-arts"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin.php:52
#: includes/admin.php:53
#: includes/admin.php:119
msgid "Site tweaks"
msgstr "Réglages du site"

#: includes/admin.php:74
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Réglages"

#. translators: 1: number of revisions, 2: number of posts, 3: size freed.
#: includes/admin.php:100
#, php-format
msgid "%1$d old revisions of %2$d pages were deleted, freeing %3$s."
msgstr "%1$d anciennes versions de %2$d pages ont été supprimées, libérant %3$s."

#: includes/admin.php:124
msgid "Revisions"
msgstr "Versions"

#: includes/admin.php:128
msgid "Versions kept per page"
msgstr "Versions conservées par page"

#: includes/admin.php:133
msgid "all"
msgstr "toutes"

#: includes/admin.php:136
msgid "Leave empty to keep every version, as WordPress does by default. Zero switches versions off altogether."
msgstr "Laissez vide pour conserver toutes les versions, comme le fait WordPress par défaut. Zéro les désactive entièrement."

#: includes/admin.php:140
msgid "On a gallery site a version is not a few paragraphs of text: it is the whole arrangement of every picture on the page, written out again each time anything is nudged. They also name the pictures under the names those pictures had at the time, so old versions go on referring to files that have since been renamed or converted."
msgstr "Sur un site de galeries, une version n’est pas quelques paragraphes de texte : c’est la disposition entière de chaque image de la page, réécrite à chaque retouche. Les versions nomment aussi les images telles qu’elles s’appelaient alors, si bien que les anciennes renvoient à des fichiers depuis renommés ou convertis."

#. translators: 1: number of revisions, 2: number of pages, 3: size.
#: includes/admin.php:149
#, php-format
msgid "Saving this page now would delete %1$d old versions across %2$d pages and free %3$s. This cannot be undone."
msgstr "Enregistrer cette page supprimerait %1$d anciennes versions réparties sur %2$d pages et libérerait %3$s. Cette action est irréversible."

#: includes/varnish.php:235
msgid "Empty the cache"
msgstr "Vider le cache"

#: includes/varnish.php:237
msgid "Asks the cache in front of the site to let the next visitor through to a fresh page."
msgstr "Demande au cache placé devant le site de laisser le prochain visiteur accéder à une page fraîche."

#: includes/varnish.php:248
msgid "You are not allowed to do that."
msgstr "Vous n’avez pas le droit de faire cela."

#: includes/varnish.php:290
msgid "The cache was emptied."
msgstr "Le cache a été vidé."

#: includes/varnish.php:291
msgid "The cache was not emptied."
msgstr "Le cache n’a pas été vidé."

#: includes/seo.php:94
msgid "Open to search engines"
msgstr "Ouvert aux moteurs de recherche"

#: includes/seo.php:95
msgid "Reading is discouraged in Settings → Reading, so the site asks not to be listed at all."
msgstr "La lecture est découragée dans Réglages → Lecture : le site demande à ne pas être référencé du tout."

#: includes/seo.php:100
msgid "The site says what it is"
msgstr "Le site dit ce qu’il est"

#: includes/seo.php:101
msgid "The tagline is empty, so the one line describing the business is missing from the title of every page."
msgstr "Le slogan est vide : la phrase qui décrit l’entreprise manque dans le titre de chaque page."

#: includes/seo.php:106
msgid "A sentence under the title in search results"
msgstr "Une phrase sous le titre dans les résultats"

#: includes/seo.php:107
msgid "No description is written into the pages, so a search engine prints whatever words it finds first."
msgstr "Aucune description n’est inscrite dans les pages : le moteur affiche les premiers mots qu’il trouve."

#: includes/seo.php:112
msgid "A picture when a link is shared"
msgstr "Une image quand un lien est partagé"

#: includes/seo.php:113
msgid "No Open Graph tags, so a link sent on WhatsApp or posted on Facebook arrives as a bare address."
msgstr "Pas de balises Open Graph : un lien envoyé sur WhatsApp ou publié sur Facebook arrive en adresse nue."

#: includes/seo.php:118
msgid "Addresses made of words"
msgstr "Des adresses faites de mots"

#: includes/seo.php:119
msgid "Permalinks are the plain kind, so every page is a number rather than its name."
msgstr "Les permaliens sont du type simple : chaque page est un numéro plutôt que son nom."

#: includes/seo.php:127
msgid "A map of the site for the crawlers"
msgstr "Un plan du site pour les robots"

#: includes/seo.php:128
msgid "The sitemap is switched off, so new albums are found only by following links."
msgstr "Le plan du site est désactivé : les nouveaux albums ne sont trouvés qu’en suivant les liens."

#: includes/seo.php:133
msgid "Served over a secure connection"
msgstr "Servi par une connexion sécurisée"

#: includes/seo.php:134
msgid "The site address is http, which browsers mark as not secure and search engines rank below https."
msgstr "L’adresse du site est en http : les navigateurs la signalent comme non sécurisée et les moteurs la classent après https."

#: includes/seo.php:150
msgid "Found and shared"
msgstr "Trouvé et partagé"

#: includes/seo.php:183
msgid "in place"
msgstr "en place"

#: includes/varnish.php:198
#: includes/varnish.php:209
msgid "The page"
msgstr "La page"

#: includes/varnish.php:199
msgid "says nothing about its age, so there is no cache in front of it to empty"
msgstr "ne dit rien de son âge : il n’y a donc pas de cache devant elle à vider"

#. translators: 1: seconds before, 2: seconds after.
#: includes/varnish.php:212
#, php-format
msgid "was %1$s old, is now %2$s"
msgstr "avait %1$s, elle a maintenant %2$s"

#: includes/varnish.php:213
msgid "of unknown age"
msgstr "un âge inconnu"

#: includes/varnish.php:214
msgid "fresh"
msgstr "fraîche"
